@host = http://localhost:5101

### Search
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=jacket&page=1&pageSize=10

### Categories
GET {{host}}/api/products/categories

### One product (full document incl. variants + attributes)
GET {{host}}/api/products/BC-TENT-001

### Barcode scan
GET {{host}}/api/products/barcode/5060000000011

### Batch lookup (used by Orders)
GET {{host}}/api/products/lookup?skus=BC-JKT-001,BC-HAT-001

### Change price -> publishes ProductPriceChanged -> ETL writes ePOS price file
PUT {{host}}/api/products/BC-HAT-001/price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 7.99 }
